# .mventor — Xerox Utility metadata
Project: Xerox Utility sidecar auto-scanner (WorkCentre 5325 @ 192.168.1.20).
Identity: see `profile.md` (Muse-owned, never edit). Thinking: see `.muse` (read-only).

## Constitution
- Sidecar only: never replace Network Scan3/TWAIN; no folder/user creation on device.
- Read-only by default: only GET + list POST; delete only on explicit user confirm.
- Modules via explicit functions, no cross-imports. No SNMP/SOAP/TWAIN.
- UI thread ≠ poller thread; lazy download only.
- Config in `%AppData%/Xerox Utility/` JSON; never hardcode IP; fail loudly.

## Architecture
Poller → Differ (watermark/box) → Notifier → Queue/Cards → Lazy downloader → Save/Convert → Delete-confirm.

## Module map (planned, `src/` empty)
- `core/`: config, watermark, device_client
- `lib/`: parse_box_lst, filename_date
- `modules/`: discover, poller, notify, cards, preview, save_convert, delete, settings
- `app/`: tray, composition

## Conventions
- Python 3.11+, requests timeout 10s, regex `var box/lst` windows-1252.
- Pillow + pypdf/img2pdf for TIFF→PDF.
- Plain text, greppable.

## State pointers
- State: `docs/PROJECT_STATE.md`
- Handover: `docs/HANDOVER.md`
- Active ticket: `tickets/` (none yet)
- Cache: `docs/cache/`
